{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100977","id":2256562494,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GgGk-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100977","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100977.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100977.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100977","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100977/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100977/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100977/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7f60546f058e5eaf6f6d439a7be1dc83b7cca33c","number":100977,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `CPUParticles2D` repeatedly scaling particles with 0 velocity and Align Y","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`CPUParticles2D` with Align Y turned on would update particles' transforms based on the velocity when velocity was non-zero, but would not set the transform for zero velocity.  This left the transfrom value from the previous call, which may have already been scaled.  In this case, each call to `_particles_process` would apply the scale again, causing the particle to repeatedly grow (or shrink for scales < 1.0).\r\n\r\nUpdated the Align Y logic to always normalize the transform values before scale is applied.\r\n\r\nFixes #99645\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4",